WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.880
An agent can finish an edit and miss the
check that would tell you if it works.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.342
The agent adds an example
and calls it done.

3
00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:13.017
Done-gate sends a reminder to the model.

4
00:00:13.017 --> 00:00:15.425
That card shows the actual reminder.

5
00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:20.440
The agent then runs the repository’s
own check, which includes the example.

6
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:30.441
If your repository has
a verification recipe,

7
00:00:30.441 --> 00:00:33.873
Done-gate can point the agent
to it before it wraps up.
